     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Inviting",
     "texto": [
      "To invite, use **Tu veux venir...** (do you want to come...?): **Tu veux venir au cinéma ce soir ?** (do you want to come to the cinema tonight?)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Accepting",
     "texto": [
      "**Avec plaisir** (with pleasure) is the usual form: **Avec plaisir !**"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Declining",
     "texto": [
      "**Désolé, je ne peux pas** (sorry, I can't). It is better to give an excuse: **Désolé, je travaille demain** (sorry, I'm working tomorrow)."
